# Minimal /etc/hosts for app containers (L-225): the JDK resolves "localhost" to
# the loopback FIRST regardless of file order and never falls back, so the
# 127.0.0.1 line must not exist. Only the host-gateway entry is present so JVM
# callers reach the host-published ports (Keycloak :8099 etc.).
169.254.1.2 localhost
